                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "Road Map",
                  "align": "center",
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Little Martians is a long-term world-building project exploring how life might evolve beyond Earth. Through autonomous AI characters, physical sculptures, animations, and interactive experiences, we're creating a bridge between current scientific understanding and future possibilities.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Each Little Martian represents a unique approach to nurturing life in extreme environments: from Verdelis's Martian gardens to Shuijing's deep-ocean studies, from Ada's Venus cloud-labs to Mycos's cosmic spore-spreading. Their stories make complex scientific concepts accessible and engaging for both adults and children.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "<strong>Current &amp; Future Developments:</strong>",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "items": [
                    "Physical Art: Ceramic sculptures and installations",
                    "Digital Beings: Autonomous AI characters you can interact with",
                    "Educational Materials: Books and learning resources",
                    "Interactive Experiences: Metaverse environments and upcoming video games",
                    "Scientific Communication: Making research accessible through storytelling",
                    "Community Projects: Workshops and collaborative world-building"
                  ],
                  "align": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Little Martians connects art, science, and technology to imagine how consciousness might evolve through symbiosis rather than competition. Join us in exploring these possibilities!",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                }
              ]
            },
